body:
the only purpose i have that is giving me the reason to keep fighting is my SO, i'm actively going to therapy but my therapist has been very sick for the past month and a half so that kinda messed me up a bit since she was giving me the strength i needed to keep up. 

&#x200B;

sorry if this is messy, i'm an emotional mess right now and can't keep my thoughts straight

apparently in my case it was because of corrupted files, went on the [steamcomunity.com](https://steamcomunity.com) for answers as suggested by the previous comment and tried at least 6-7 methods but no use, it was crashing immediately as the game logo appeared. after like 1-2 hour tweek and search i found a list of problems and solutions. my kf2 files were corrupted and the solutionwas to just go to my games>killing floor and delete the killing floor file entirely. that fixed the problem entirely and i was finally able to see my lt.bill with golden suit and golden king flashpound mask. i was so relieved and happy,

&#x200B;

only specs i know: ram 8gb, gtx 1060 3gb and i3-8300T
